Changed the `console_ports`, `console_server_ports`, `power_ports`, `power_outlets`, `interfaces` and `device_bays` filters on `DeviceTypeFilterSet`, and the `local_config_context_data` filter on `LocalContextModelFilterSetMixin`, from `method=`-based `BooleanFilter` to `RelatedMembershipBooleanFilter`. Results are unchanged; the filters are now introspectable and covered by the generic boolean filter test.
